-- title:
--   Power series realisation of the origin chart ring
-- statement:
--   Let $T$ be a commutative ring and let $W$ be a Weierstrass curve over $T$, with associated projective model. Write $R = \mathrm{MvPolynomial}\,(\mathrm{Fin}\ 3)\ T / (F)$ for the quotient of the polynomial ring in three variables by the ideal generated by the homogeneous Weierstrass cubic of $W$, graded by the images $\mathrm{projModelGradingCR}\,W\,(i)$ of the homogeneous degree-$i$ submodules under the quotient map, and let $\mathrm{coord}\,W\,i$ denote the class of the $i$-th variable. The ring `OriginChartRing W` is the degree-zero homogeneous localisation `Away` of this graded ring at $\mathrm{coord}\,W\,1$, i.e. the chart where the second coordinate is inverted; inside it, $\mathrm{xOverY}\,W$ and $\mathrm{zOverY}\,W$ are the degree-zero fractions with numerators $\mathrm{coord}\,W\,0$ and $\mathrm{coord}\,W\,2$ and denominator $\mathrm{coord}\,W\,1$. The assertion is that there exists a ring homomorphism $\Phi$ from `OriginChartRing W` to the formal power series ring $T\langle\!\langle X\rangle\!\rangle$ such that: for every $t \in T$, $\Phi$ sends the image in the chart ring of the degree-zero element determined by $t$ to the constant series `PowerSeries.C t`; $\Phi(\mathrm{xOverY}\,W) = -X$; and $\Phi(\mathrm{zOverY}\,W) = -\,W.\mathrm{formalW}$, where $W.\mathrm{formalW}$ is the power series whose $n$-th coefficient is the $n$-th coefficient of the $n$-th iterate of the Weierstrass substitution $\mathrm{wSubst}$ applied to $0$.
--
--   This is the formal parametrisation of a Weierstrass model at the origin, in the classical normalisation $z = -x/y$, $w = -1/y$: the chart in which the $Y$-coordinate is invertible receives a map to $T\langle\!\langle Z\rangle\!\rangle$ realising the formal group parameter. It supports the analysis of the local structure at the origin, and is used in the study of divisors concentrated at the origin and of Drinfeld-type bases in the formal neighbourhood.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_WeierstrassCurve_DrinfeldGlobal_exists_ringHom_originChartRing_powerSeries.lean

